	abstract = {An exact probabilistic treatment of conduction properties of random Bethe resistor lattices is presented In the special case of substitutional disorder where a faction 1 - p of resistors is removed, our treatment readily gives the known exact results for the conductance and voltage correlations in the critical region p + p,. The simplicity of our method allows a generalization to the case where the remaining fraction p of resistors also has an arbitrary distribution. We are also able to discuss the case where each element of the lattice is composed of several independently distributed resistive and reactive parts.},
